@startuml
scale 2
robust "R" as R
concise "C" as C
binary "B" as B
analog "A" between 0 and 10 as A
rectangle "X" as X
clock Clk with period 10
@0
R is a
C is b
B is low
A is 2
X is p
@20
R is c
C is d
B is high
A is 8
X is q
@40
R is a
C is b
B is low
A is 4
X is p
R@0 -> C@10 : r to c
Clk@10 -> B@25 : clk
A@20 <-> @40 : {20 ms}
note top of R : top
note bottom of C : bottom
highlight 10 to 30 #Gold;line:red : zone
@enduml
